{"title":"마오","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=d3eFT/hAd4fn6YTP/3ijmwN9oUc2oL8lWkmWbsk&filename=th3","synopsis":"초등학교 1학년 때, 일가 전원이 사고에 휘말렸지만 혼자 살아남은 과거를 가진 키바 나노카.\n중학교 3학년이 된 그녀가 다시 사고현장을 지나자, 갑자기 다이쇼 시대가 되는데! 거기서 만난 음양사 소년, 마오로부터 \"너, 요괴지.\" 라는 얘기를 들은 다음 날, 나노카의 신체능력이 각성했다. 자신의 \"수수께끼\"를 풀기 위해, 나노카는 마오와 행동을 함께 한다. 사건현장의 역사와 고양이 요괴, 그리고 마오와 나노카의 수수께끼가 조금씩 연결되기 시작되고…!! 두 세계가 교차하는 곳에서, 운명적으로 만난 마오와 나노카의 다이쇼기괴로망! © Rumiko TAKAHASHI/SHOGAKUKAN","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":184,"change":{"type":"down","amount":136}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":246,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":102}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":112,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":184,"change":{"type":"down","amount":72}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":136,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":199,"change":{"type":"down","amount":63}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":169,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":29,"change":{"type":"up","amount":82}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":178,"change":{"type":"down","amount":149}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":232,"change":{"type":"down","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":149,"change":{"type":"up","amount":83}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":185,"change":{"type":"down","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":94,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":182,"change":{"type":"down","amount":88}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":234,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":166,"change":{"type":"up","amount":68}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":72}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":247,"c